1
00:00:02,627 --> 00:00:03,627
What's wrong?

2
00:00:04,671 --> 00:00:05,714
Were you hurt?

3
00:00:06,172 --> 00:00:07,507
It's an old injury
but I think

4
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:10,260
it got worse.

5
00:00:11,219 --> 00:00:12,219
Sorry.

6
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:13,429
There is no one else

7
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:15,640
who can pitch in our team.

8
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:17,892
So he can't throw anymore?

9
00:00:18,601 --> 00:00:19,601
I don't think

10
00:00:20,437 --> 00:00:21,757
I can throw fastballs
like before.

11
00:00:22,105 --> 00:00:22,814
Oh.

12
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:23,982
What do we do?

13
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:26,194
There aren't many days left
until the tournament!

14
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:27,402
Hey, Jeongho.

15
00:00:27,485 --> 00:00:28,945
Please, say something!

16
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:31,864
Don't try to get

17
00:00:32,448 --> 00:00:33,448
strikeouts.

18
00:00:33,575 --> 00:00:35,702
What do you mean
don't try to get strikeouts?

19
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:39,372
Baseball isn't
solely about strikeouts.

20
00:00:40,165 --> 00:00:40,957
Grounders

21
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:42,166
and fly balls

22
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,626
all count as being out.

23
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:45,002
Believe in the defense

24
00:00:45,336 --> 00:00:46,336
and adjust your style.

25
00:00:46,838 --> 00:00:47,589
But...

26
00:00:47,797 --> 00:00:48,797
You saw it too.

27
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:50,507
Our team mates

28
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:52,977
trained so hard
that their uniforms got torn.

29
00:00:53,428 --> 00:00:55,096
Hard work never lies.

30
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:56,513
He's right.

31
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:59,017
We practiced until we could
barely lift our arms.

32
00:01:00,143 --> 00:01:02,145
Just believe in us
and throw it as you please.

33
00:01:02,145 --> 00:01:03,521
We will catch them all.

34
00:01:04,563 --> 00:01:05,899
If you can't throw a fastball

35
00:01:06,816 --> 00:01:08,068
you can a throw
a breaking ball.

36
00:01:08,485 --> 00:01:09,485
After that

37
00:01:10,653 --> 00:01:11,738
I'll have your back.

38
00:01:13,364 --> 00:01:15,324
You don't have to overwork
yourself anymore.

39
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:16,325
We're a team.

40
00:01:17,827 --> 00:01:18,827
Thanks.

41
00:01:20,580 --> 00:01:21,580
Sorry.

42
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:23,040
Let's go practice.

43
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:24,334
Yeah.

44
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:25,459
Let's go!
